@startuml
[*] --> Pending : createOrder()

state "待执行 (PENDING)" as Pending
state "执行中 (EXECUTING)" as Executing
state "成功 (SUCCESS)" as Success
state "失败 (FAILED)" as Failed

Pending --> Pending : autoCheck
Pending --> Executing : executeOrder()

Executing --> Success : Deliver() passed
Executing --> Failed : Fail()

Success --> [*] : jars delivered
Failed --> [*] : RollbackSlaveToMaster()

note right of Pending
  Manual execution available
  Auto-check for feasibility
end note

note right of Executing
  Type A: master only (无需从台)
  Type B: master -> transfer -> slave -> deliver
  转移失败(从台容量不足) -> Failed
end note
@enduml
